    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "e2b_orchestrator_oom_kill_cumulative_total：orchestrator 被 OOM 后 Nomad 会立即拉起、cgroup 计数器归零，该指标由 exporter 状态机跨重启累计，不会因重启丢失。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "0",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        }
      },
